<title>SWEDEN: Ericsson says took mobile phone mkt share.</title>
<headline>Ericsson says took mobile phone mkt share.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish telecoms group Ericsson said on Friday it took market shares on mobile handsets in the first quarter.</p>
<p>&quot;Mobile handsets increased sales by 100 percent in the first quarter but the market hasn't grown that much -- consequently we have taken market share,&quot; spokesman Per Bengtsson told a telephone conference.</p>
<p>The company reported earlier that pre-tax profit rose 30 percent to 2.02 billion crowns.</p>
<p>-- Jorgen Osterberg, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
</text>
